\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces End-to-end verification pipeline. The observed sequence is compared against the claimed identity's enrolled signature \emph  {before} pooling, and a three-stage temporal CNN classifies the $T\times 234$ comparison tensor. The auxiliary branch holds $715{,}556$ of the model's $848{,}614$ parameters but receives no gradient and never reaches the decision path (Section~\ref {sec:aux}).}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
