\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The asymmetry the method exploits. The generator rewrites only the face-confined band, so a forgery claiming subject~$B$ still walks with subject~$A$'s gait. The generator never models locomotion, so this inconsistency is structural, not an artefact better synthesis will remove.}}{3}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:threat}{{2}{3}{The asymmetry the method exploits. The generator rewrites only the face-confined band, so a forgery claiming subject~$B$ still walks with subject~$A$'s gait. The generator never models locomotion, so this inconsistency is structural, not an artefact better synthesis will remove}{figure.2}{}}
